  "title": "Melt-In-Your-Mouth Smoked Pork Back Ribs",
  "description": "Pork back ribs covered in a paprika dry rub are smoked for 5 1/2 hours in this easy recipe that yields melt-in-your-mouth tender ribs.",
  "authors": [
    "How To Smoke"
  ],
